                        <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">A proteome-wide atlas of lysine-reactive chemistry</h1>
                        <ul class="c-article-author-list c-article-author-list--short" data-test="authors-list" data-component-authors-activator="authors-list"><li class="c-article-author-list__item"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="1_14" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Mikail_E_-Abbasov-Aff1-Aff2" data-author-popup="auth-Mikail_E_-Abbasov-Aff1-Aff2" data-author-search="Abbasov, Mikail E." data-corresp-id="c1">Mikail E. Abbasov<svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-mail-medium"></use></svg></a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff1">1</a>,<a href="#Aff2">2</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="2_14" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Madeline_E_-Kavanagh-Aff1" data-author-popup="auth-Madeline_E_-Kavanagh-Aff1" data-author-search="Kavanagh, Madeline E.">Madeline E. Kavanagh</a><span class="u-js-hide"> 
